sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Admin membership change, audit and response
  accDescr: A confirmed browser change sends an expected team version to the OAuth-only endpoint. A workspace lock serializes membership changes. Current admin role, version and final-admin protection are rechecked before membership, version and audit commit atomically. Revocation deletes sessions. A conflict or uncertain response requires a roster reload before further editing.
  autonumber
  participant UI as Admin team screen
  participant API as PUT /api/team
  participant DB as PostgreSQL transaction

  UI->>UI: Confirm target numeric ID and role
  UI->>API: Cookie + exact Origin + JSON<br/>version, githubUserId, role or null
  API->>API: Live OAuth and current admin<br/>4 KiB body, strict fields, 5s deadline
  alt Invalid access or input
    API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 / 408 / 413 / 415
    UI->>UI: Explain failure, denied access clears roster
  else Authorized request
    API->>DB: Begin bounded transaction
    DB->>DB: Lock workspace FOR UPDATE<br/>Recheck acting admin<br/>Compare teamVersion
    alt Stale version or final admin removal
      DB-->>API: Rollback
      API-->>UI: 409, reload before editing again
    else Current version and permitted target change
      alt Membership actually changes
        DB->>DB: Grant / change role / revoke<br/>Revocation cascades session deletion
        DB->>DB: Increment teamVersion<br/>Append actor-attributed TeamAccessEvent
      else Current-version no-op
        DB->>DB: Keep version, no invented audit event
      end
      DB->>DB: Commit transaction
      DB-->>API: version + changed
      API-->>UI: 200 + no-store
      UI->>API: Reload directory and refresh own session
      API-->>UI: Confirmed roster or updated access
      UI->>UI: Enable edits only after successful reload
    end
  end
  Note over UI,DB: Lost responses do not prove rollback. Editing stays paused until reloaded.<br/>The operator CLI uses the same locked engine and final-admin rule,<br/>with operator attribution and no browser version requirement.
